Optimized throughput and parallelism for small‑scale datasets.

Integrated SQL and Data Lake seamlessly for hybrid data architecture.

Enhanced monitoring and debugging using ADF run metrics and JSON outputs.

🪄 How to Use
Upload Load_FactBookings1.csv to your SQL table (FactBookings1).

Run the pipeline SQL_Datalake_Inc_FactBookings1 in ADF.

Verify output in Data Lake under /incremental/Factbooking1/lastload.

Use Additional_Data_Insert.docx to simulate new data and rerun the pipeline for incremental testing.

